{"suttaId":"thi-ap31","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[9953,9990],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"thi-ap31:0.3":"Yasavatīpamukhaaṭṭhārasabhikkhunīsahassaapadānaṃ","thi-ap31:1.1":"“Bhavā sabbe parikkhīṇā, bhavā santi vimocitā;","thi-ap31:1.3":"Sabbāsavā ca no natthi, ārocema mahāmune.","thi-ap31:2.1":"“Purimaṃ kusalaṃ kammaṃ [parikammañca kusalaṃ (syā.)], yaṃ kiñci sādhupatthitaṃ;","thi-ap31:2.3":"Paribhogamayaṃ dinnaṃ, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap31:3.1":"“Buddhapaccekabuddhānaṃ, sāvakānañca patthitaṃ [buddhānaṃ sāvakānañca (sī. ka.)];","thi-ap31:3.3":"Paribhogamayaṃ dinnaṃ, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap31:4.1":"“Uccanīcamayaṃ kammaṃ, bhikkhūnaṃ sādhupatthitaṃ;","thi-ap31:4.3":"Uccākulaparikammaṃ, katametaṃ mahāmune [katamhehi mahāmune (syā. pī.)].","thi-ap31:5.1":"“Teneva sukkamūlena, coditā kammasampadā;","thi-ap31:5.3":"Mānusikamatikkantā, jāyiṃsu khattiye kule.","thi-ap31:6.1":"“Uppatte ca kate kamme, jātiyā vāpi ekato;","thi-ap31:6.3":"Pacchime ekato jātā, khattiyā kulasambhavā.","thi-ap31:7.1":"“Rūpavatī bhogavatī, lābhasakkārapūjitā;","thi-ap31:7.3":"Antepure mahāvīra, devānaṃ viya nandane.","thi-ap31:8.1":"“Nibbinditvā agāramhā, pabbajimhanagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap31:8.3":"Katipāhaṃ upādāya, sabbā pattāmha nibbutiṃ.","thi-ap31:9.1":"“Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañca, paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;","thi-ap31:9.3":"Upanenti bahū amhe, sadā sakkatapūjitā.","thi-ap31:10.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā amhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","thi-ap31:10.3":"Nāgīva bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāma anāsavā.","thi-ap31:11.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata no āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","thi-ap31:11.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap31:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","thi-ap31:12.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap31:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ yasavatīpamukhāni khattiyakaññābhikkhuniyo aṭṭhārasasahassāni bhagavato sammukhā imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap31:14.1":"Yasavatīpamukhaaṭṭhārasabhikkhunīsahassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
